<div class="pagehead"><div><div class="eyebrow">ACXIOMCRM / GOOD TO SEE YOU, @User.Identity?.Name?.Split('@')[0].ToUpper()</div><h1>Good to see you, @User.Identity?.Name?.Split('@')[0]</h1><div class="muted">Here is what is happening across your customer and sales workspace.</div></div><a asp-controller="Customers" asp-action="Create" class="btn btn-primary">+ Add customer</a></div><div class="statgrid"><div class="stat"><small>Total customers</small><strong>@ViewBag.Customers</strong><small>Active relationship base</small></div><div class="stat"><small>Active leads</small><strong>@ViewBag.Leads</strong><small>Open leads in your scope</small></div><div class="stat"><small>Open opportunities</small><strong>@ViewBag.Opportunities</strong><small>Active deals</small></div><div class="stat"><small>Weighted pipeline</small><strong>@(((decimal)ViewBag.Pipeline).ToString("C0"))</strong><small>Amount × probability</small></div></div><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-lg-7"><div class="panel"><h3>Sales workspace</h3><p class="muted">Manage your relationships, qualify leads and move opportunities forward.</p><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" asp-controller="Leads" asp-action="Index">View leads</a><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" asp-controller="Opportunities" asp-action="Index">View pipeline</a><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" asp-controller="FollowUps" asp-action="Index">Follow-ups</a></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-5"><div class="panel"><h3>Follow-ups requiring attention</h3><strong class="display-6">@ViewBag.FollowUps</strong><p class="muted">Planned follow-ups due today or overdue.</p><a asp-controller="FollowUps" asp-action="Index">Open follow-ups →</a></div></div></div>
